From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 09:38:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Link libpulse against libsndfile_linux

WayDroid-ATV's libsndfile (lineage-20, rewritten 2026-09-22) names its
vendor library libsndfile_linux; libsndfile12 no longer exists, so Soong
stopped at analysis.
---
 src/Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/Android.bp b/src/Android.bp
index 9f70afa..6d5d710 100644
--- a/src/Android.bp
+++ b/src/Android.bp
@@ -184,7 +184,7 @@ cc_library_shared {
     shared_libs: [
         "libjson",
         "libasound",
-        "libsndfile12",
+        "libsndfile_linux",
     ],
 
 }
